    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "llvm-tblgen compiles every pattern into a matcher table that the selector interprets.",
      "narration": "At build time, llvm-tblgen with gen-dag-isel compiles all patterns into a matcher table, such as AArch64GenDAGISel.inc. At compile time, SelectCodeCommon interprets that table against the DAG.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "h",
